<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">strength</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">strength</ansi> stat measures your physical might.

<ansi fg="yellow">Effects: </ansi>

Greater Strength lets you hit harder in combat, increasing
the damage you deal with both armed and unarmed attacks.
It also determines how much you can carry before becoming
encumbered, and influences your ability to overpower foes
in grapples and disarm attempts.

Strength improves through use -- the more you rely on raw
power in your adventures, the more it grows.

